        "number": 12,
        "internalPageId": 11,
        "title": "Language Targets",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Language Targets",
          "ASPECTS / FUNCTIONS EXAMPLES 1 Denote existence. There is a cup of coffee here. / There are apples in the basket. 2 State quantities There isn’t any sugar left. / I don’t have much salt at home. 3 Talk about what people eat. John has a sandwich for breakfast. / They take hot chocolate at nights.",
          "When we talk about food we can consider the following aspects.",
          "TO CONSIDER Most of the statements either talk about existence or quantities, but we also can use this topic to include other aspects as it can bee seen in number 3."
        ],
