        "number": 16,
        "internalPageId": 15,
        "title": "1. She has a big family. (T) (F) 2. There is not enough food for them. (T) (F) 3. Weekly, they buy cheese, milk, eggs etc. (T) (F) 4. They always buy a lot of coffee. (T) (F)",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "1. She has a big family. (T) (F) 2. There is not enough food for them. (T) (F) 3. Weekly, they buy cheese, milk, eggs etc. (T) (F) 4. They always buy a lot of coffee. (T) (F)",
          "C. Read the following paragraph and state if the sentences are true (T) or false (F). After that, read the paragraph aloud to your teacher.",
          "Our weekly Shops My family is not that big, so, at home, there is always enough food for all of us. There are certain products that we normally buy weekly, such as cheese, milk, eggs etc. We do not get much coffee because my dad is the only one who drinks it for breakfast; however, we buy a lot of fruit and some bottles of juice because we do not take any soda. My mother likes getting some cookies and around two or three boxes of cereal. We always go together to the supermarket.",
          "5. They don’t eat much fruit. (T) (F) 6. They drink some soda. (T) (F) 7. Her mother gets only one box of cereal. (T) (F) 8. They never go together to the supermarket. (T) (F)"
        ],
